/* ============ Sample places ============ */
// Default stops used to seed the "trip-default" trip on first load and
// whenever the user clicks "Reset to sample".
//
// Stops that belong to a package reference it via `packageId`; the package
// definitions live in sample-packages.js.
//
// Plain (non-module) script: the top-level `const` is shared with app.js through
// the global lexical scope. Load this file BEFORE app.js in index.html.

